<title>Bangladesh: Port conditions update-Bangladesh, Algeria-Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update-Bangladesh, Algeria-Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>CHITTAGONG, Oct 14 - Berthing delay for general cargo</p>
<p>vessels two to three days.</p>
<p>ALGIERS, Oct 15 - During the last two weeks four to five vessels reported at anchorage awaiting berths. Average waiting time about one or two days.</p>
</text>
